{
    "pageid": 2165,
    "title": "Notifications",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "CK2 being a complex sandbox game, the amount of notifications received by the player is vital: too few and opportunities will be missed, too many and game will become a headache."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "There are two types of notifications: messages and alerts."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Messages",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Messages are notifications that depend on a configurable priority based on the message source and category."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Sources",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Close relatives",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Characters of interest: they are marked via the important character toggle after right-click. They are limited to maximum 20 characters (list is visible in the outliner)",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Other characters: any character not in the previous cases.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Priorities",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "table",
                    "rows": [
                        [
                            "",
                            "Priority",
                            "Description"
                        ],
                        [
                            "",
                            "Priority 1",
                            "Message appears as a popup, similar to events."
                        ],
                        [
                            "",
                            "Priority 2 (High priority)",
                            "Message appears in the high priority message feed. Newer message will appear on top of existing ones, and will disappear after a few months."
                        ],
                        [
                            "",
                            "Priority 3 (Low priority)",
                            "Message appears in the low priority message feed. Newer message will appear on top of existing ones, and will disappear after a few months."
                        ],
                        [
                            "",
                            "Priority 4",
                            "Message appears in the log feed. It can be accessed by clicking the (+) button on the bottom of the screen."
                        ],
                        [
                            "",
                            "Priority 5",
                            "Message does not appear"
                        ]
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Settings",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "For each category of messages and the source of the message, a priority can be set."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Default settings are in \\common\\Crusader Kings II\\interface\\messagetypes.txt"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Custom settings are saved under \\Documents\\Paradox Interactive\\Crusader Kings II\\interface\\messagetypes_custom.txt"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "After a major patch, custom settings will be reset to the new defaults, so for heavily customised settings, it might be worth keeping a backup and manually merging with the new settings."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Alerts",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Alerts are the circular icons at the top of the screen."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "It is not possible to add new alerts via modding."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "By right-clicking an alert, you can:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Dismiss it temporarily"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Disable it forever"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Restoring alerts",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "In order to restore disabled or dismissed alerts:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ol",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Open the outliner category configuration",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Check the box Disabled Alerts",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "In the outliner, click on the alerts that need to be restored",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
